This project is an independent MLX (Apple Silicon) implementation inspired by,
and in places derived from, the architecture of:

  MotionBricks — "Scalable Real-Time Motions with Modular Latent Generative
  Model and Smart Primitives", NVIDIA (NVlabs/GR00T-WholeBodyControl,
  motionbricks/).  Source code: Apache License 2.0.
  Pretrained model weights: NVIDIA Open Model License.

We take the source-code route only (Apache-2.0): no NVIDIA pretrained weights
are used, converted or redistributed. Every checkpoint this project produces is
trained from data we generate ourselves. Files carrying upstream-derived code
mark the change and the origin in a header comment.
